170	    /**
171	     * Handles {@link MissingOwnerFieldsException} raised when an owner payload is missing or blank in one
172	     * or more required fields. Returns a 400 Bad Request whose {@code errors} array lists the name of each
173	     * offending field.
174	     *
175	     * @param e The {@link MissingOwnerFieldsException} to be handled
